### 工单管理 API 测试脚本
### 在 IntelliJ IDEA 中，可以直接点击请求左边的箭头运行

@host = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 创建工单
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "数据库连接故障",
  "description": "生产环境 MySQL 无法连接",
  "priority": "CRITICAL",
  "systemName": "payment-system",
  "assignee": "张三"
}

### 2. 创建第二个工单
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "API 超时问题",
  "description": "用户反馈 API 响应时间过长",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "systemName": "api-gateway",
  "assignee": "李四"
}

### 3. 创建第三个工单
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "文档更新",
  "description": "更新 API 文档和使用说明",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "systemName": "documentation"
}

### 4. 获取所有工单
GET {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. 按状态筛选 - 获取所有开放工单
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=OPEN
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6. 按优先级筛选 - 获取所有高优先级工单
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?priority=HIGH
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 7. 按优先级筛选 - 获取所有关键工单
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?priority=CRITICAL
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 8. 按系统名筛选
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?systemName=payment-system
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 9. 多条件筛选 - 开放且高优先级
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=OPEN&priority=HIGH
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 10. 多条件筛选 - 所有条件
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=OPEN&priority=CRITICAL&systemName=payment-system
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 11. 获取工单详情 (id=1)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 12. 获取工单详情 (id=2)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 13. 获取不存在的工单 (应返回 404)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 14. 更新工单状态为 INVESTIGATING
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

"INVESTIGATING"

### 15. 更新工单状态为 RESOLVED
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

"RESOLVED"

### 16. 更新工单状态为 CLOSED
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

"CLOSED"

### 17. 更新负责人
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/2/assignee
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

"王五"

### 18. 更新处理备注
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/2/note
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

"已启动调查，预计 2 小时内解决"

### 19. 更新处理备注 - 第二条工单
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/1/note
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

"问题已解决，已验证"

### 20. 删除工单 (id=3)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tickets/3
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 21. 验证删除 - 尝试获取已删除的工单 (应返回 404)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/3
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 22. 最终状态 - 获取所有工单列表
GET {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 测试错误情况

### 23. 创建工单时缺少标题 (应返回 400)
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "没有标题的工单",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### 24. 更新状态为非法值 (应返回 400)
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

"INVALID_STATUS"

### 25. 删除不存在的工单 (应返回 404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tickets/999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### H2 数据库控制台
### 浏览器访问: http://localhost:8080/h2-console

